.TH RETA\-EXTRACT\-HTML\-CLASSES 1 "July 2026" "reta_arch_mojo" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
reta\-extract\-html\-classes \- public wrapper for extracting generated HTML class names
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B reta\-extract\-html\-classes
.RI [ ARGUMENT ...]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B reta\-extract\-html\-classes
runs the native HTML class extractor. It is a public wrapper around reta\-extract\-html\-classes\-native.

.SH EXIT STATUS
Returns 0 on success and non-zero on errors, failed checks, missing build targets, or invalid arguments.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR reta(1), rp(1), rpl(1), rpe(1), rpb(1), generate_html(1)
